# Normalize line endings to LF so Git stops reporting phantom modifications.
#
# Without this, `git status` on Windows shows ~200 files as modified while
# `git diff` reports zero changed lines, which makes every real change
# unreviewable. `* text=auto eol=lf` records the intent in the repository, so
# it applies to every clone and not just this machine.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.webp binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.eot binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
*.gz binary

# These are explicitly text, so keep them LF like everything else.
*.svg text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf